{title: White flag}
{artist: Dido}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]I know you think that,        I shouldnt still love you,
Ill [Am]tell you that.        But if [Dm]I didnt say it,
well Id still have felt it,        [Am]wheres the sense in that?
I [C]promise Im not trying,        to make your life harder
Or [Dm]return to where we [C]were,        [Bb]Well I will go down
with this [F]ship,        And I wont [Gm]put my hands up
and [Dm]surrender,        There will be [Bb]no white flag
above my [F]door,        Im in [C]love and always [Gm]will be
[Dm]I know I left too much mess,        and destruction
to [Am]come back again,        And I [Dm]caused you nothing but
trouble I understand,        if you cant [Am]talk to me again
And if you [C]live by the rules,        of "its over"
then Im [Dm]sure that that makes,        [C]sense
And when we [F]meet,        Which Im sure we will
All that was [Am]then,        Will be there still
Ill let it [Gm]pass,        And hold my tongue
And you will [C]think,        That Ive moved on....
